0:{"buildId":"A2KDDaJI2Oei_cuPJJym6","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Life abroad"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"MANAGE YOUR FINANCES ABROAD"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"HOW TO MANAGE YOUR FINANCES ABROAD! The world today is more liberal and open vis-a-vis other nations. One most common way of erasing boundaries is student exchange programmes or allowing more individuals to study within your country by making the process simpler. Travelling to your dream city/could start adrenaline rush in your body. However, studying abroad could be expensive, more so for Indians as rupees stand no chance in front of dollars,pounds etc. Nonetheless, all is not lost in paradise and with sound financial planning, one can fulfil their dream of studying abroad."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The guide",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The guide"}],[["$","p","You have to manage your money very effectively in abroad . Spending unnecessary money on unnecessary things could make you broke . We understand that travelling abroad could be very overwhelming and exciting for you. You might have waited all your life to live the most happening yet unbounded lifestyle there. It’s normal to get influenced from your surroundings but smartness isn’t in showing off how good and partyholic rich lifestyle you are living but real smartness is in knowing when and how to use your money effectively.",{"children":"You have to manage your money very effectively in abroad . Spending unnecessary money on unnecessary things could make you broke . We understand that travelling abroad could be very overwhelming and exciting for you. You might have waited all your life to live the most happening yet unbounded lifestyle there. It’s normal to get influenced from your surroundings but smartness isn’t in showing off how good and partyholic rich lifestyle you are living but real smartness is in knowing when and how to use your money effectively."}],["$","p","6 Helpful tips to manage your finances abroad",{"children":"6 Helpful tips to manage your finances abroad"}],["$","p","1.The Big B:-",{"children":"1.The Big B:-"}],["$","p","Budgeting plays a crucial role when it comes to studying abroad. Many people often start budgeting in the later stages but this is a very tricky gamble. We always recommend people to first start with a budget. This will come in handy in shortlisting colleges and universities as well.",{"children":"Budgeting plays a crucial role when it comes to studying abroad. Many people often start budgeting in the later stages but this is a very tricky gamble. We always recommend people to first start with a budget. This will come in handy in shortlisting colleges and universities as well."}],["$","p","It is very important to be realistic when formulating the budget. “We will see” attitude can drown you in a pool of sorrows and we definitely wouldn’t like that for you. Finding the right balance between your income and expenses is the real deal of budgeting. Knowing the difference between what you need and what you want will determine your spending habits and the level of comfort you enjoy financially.",{"children":"It is very important to be realistic when formulating the budget. “We will see” attitude can drown you in a pool of sorrows and we definitely wouldn’t like that for you. Finding the right balance between your income and expenses is the real deal of budgeting. Knowing the difference between what you need and what you want will determine your spending habits and the level of comfort you enjoy financially."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"],"$L10"]}],"$L11"]}],"$L12"]}]}],"$L13"]}],["$L14"],"$L15"]}],"isPartial":"$@16","staleTime":"$17","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L18","isPartial":"$@19","staleTime":"$17","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L1a","isPartial":"$@1b","staleTime":"$17","varyParams":"$1c"},{"rsc":"$L1d","isPartial":"$@1e","staleTime":"$17","varyParams":"$1c"},{"rsc":"$L1f","isPartial":"$@20","staleTime":"$17","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@21","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@22"}
